          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo pazia kuibonye kwa midi ya mgholeka misanu; kuishinge dhahabu, nao kuifunge koleo ra dhahabu, na kuwika vishawalata visanu va shaba nandonyi yaro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
